{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"环路群"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"环路群"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"代数几何","text":"代数几何"}},{"Plain":"中, 一个群的环路群是指"},{"Local":{"url":"去心形式圆盘","text":"去心形式圆盘"}},{"Plain":"到它的映射构成的群, 即"},{"Local":{"url":"环路空间(代数几何)","text":"环路空间"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}